{"gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Wonderful. Anne is very friendly, very welcoming and very knowledgeable about the area and things to do.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 194, "out_tok": 50}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|A lovely place to stay, comfortable, clean and friendly - Anne is a great hostess - helpful and charming. I loved the bedroom and the bed was a dream - I haven't slept so well in ages! I can't wait to return. My only fear is that too many people get to know what a good place this is!!": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 244, "out_tok": 57}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Sadly, I was too ill to travel, but my Hostess was most understanding. I will certainly look forward to staying there in future.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 202, "out_tok": 45}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Our stay at Robin´s was really nice. Although we unfortunately didn´t meet, we were supplied with every information we needed - from traveling around over shopping facilities, eating out - to milk and coffee in the flat at our arrival.... The flat is in good condition and easy to find in a seven minutes walk from the tube-station. The surrounding is clean and silent which is really great after a busy day in the city. ": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"noise\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 262, "out_tok": 67}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Found everything as described. Nice place with the added touch of Oyster cards provided as well as a laptop with lots of info about the area. Location is great, near Camden Town and its markets but also easy access to public transport and the West End.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 224, "out_tok": 51}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|This place was a good place to stay. Robin was helpful and non-intrusive. We found it easy to get the bus and tube to travel all over london. The four flights of stairs didn't bother us. We would definitely stay there again. A great deal.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"value\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 231, "out_tok": 55}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Very kind host, and smooth communication, enjoyed staying very much. Easy access to the town by few buses, and close to the park!": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 202, "out_tok": 50}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|THE place to be, so nice house, so nice people in a quiet district close to many parcs, canal, and transport. hope we will have opportunity to get back!": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"noise\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 210, "out_tok": 55}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Anne was a very welcoming host. Accommodation was in a perfect location only a stone's throw from Battersea Park - one of the best parks in London. I didn't take public transport, opting to walk through the park and along the Thames to work in the morning. It took me 45 minutes to Lambeth Bridge and was the most stress-free journey to work I've ever had. Bed was very comfortable. Shower was hot. Dogs were very friendly. It felt like a proper home from home.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 280, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|I enjoyed my stay very much. The twin room is spacious and very comfortable. Anne is a very gracious host and very accomodating regarding hours, luggage dropoff etc. Close to bus routes and Battersea Park.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 217, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|staying in Anne´s house was very nice. she is very, very sweet, the room is very cosy and the house also cosy and very clean. she has two very nice dogs. ": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 214, "out_tok": 57}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|A great location and an excellent host. The flat is about 5 minutes walk from Oxford Circus so is perfectly located for exploring Central London. We arrived a little early and instead of making us wait Paolo took our bags into the office and moved them into the flat before he left allowing us to spend longer exploring London. He also had a lovely conversation with us checking that we knew where we were going and what we were doing. The flat was excellent having been newly refurbished. It has a TV and a full kitchen and a small but perfect bathroom. A perfect place to stay, we'll definitely be returning.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 296, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|An amazing well equipped apartment, perfectly located to explore London. The hosts communication and help/advice also was excellent and help aid the trip . I would highly recommend": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 207, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|The location of Anne's home was fantastic. One short bus ride from her home to Victoria Station, and downtown London. Her location to Battersea park is also key. When London gets to be too busy, and you want a break, the Park is at your doorstep. Ann is a fabulous hostess. Kind, helpful, and interested in knowing you are having a good time. The room was bright and cheery, and her home was organized and clean. I wholeheartedly recommend this BNB location to anyone visiting London.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\",\n    \"value\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 277, "out_tok": 67}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Had a brilliant weekend in Tim's apartment. Lovely bright apartment with and classy neutral colour scheme throughout right in the middle of Camden Town. Great location for getting around on the Northern Line and the walk/jog along the canal in either direction to Regents Park one way and Kings Cross in the other direction made it a perfect place to start the day. After a day of shopping/sightseeing coming back to the apartment for a gorgeous shower and then wine on the balcony was just perfect. It was an added bonus being able to park the car securely as well. Thanks Tim ": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\",\n    \"safety\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 289, "out_tok": 61}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|This apartment was lovely. It was immaculate throughout. It is light, bright and airy and was a very pleasant place to stay. The location is excellent, close to a number of train and tube stations and very close to the main road to easily hail a cab. Tim was friendly and helpful throughout all communications. I would definitely stay here again and highly recommend it to anyone visiting London. ": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"host\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 252, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Marco provided clear information on how to get to the flat and how to use everything. He also responded quickly to any questions I had during my stay. The flat was exactly as advertised. Very clean and tidy and all the facilities that I needed. Location was good. I was working in Canary Wharf and the flat is less than 10 minutes walk from Canada Water tube station. Tesco supermarket just around the corner.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"amenities\",\n    \"location\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 257, "out_tok": 62}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Eliana is more than just your host. She will be your mom away from home. She's really quick on feedback and can really help you find your way around the city. Location has a nice quiet neighborhood and even though it's not city center you can easily get a bus there (runs 24/7). Rooms and the house are really cosy. Thank you for everything Eliana!": {"output": "{\"sentiment\": \"positive\", \"aspects_positive\": [\"host\", \"location\", \"amenities\", \"noise\"], \"aspects_negative\": [], \"language\": \"en\"}", "in_tok": 256, "out_tok": 38}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Wonderful staying in Marco s apartment, the house is very comfy and clean. Is very close to the tube station and is perfect for a short or long rent. Marco is been very helpful before and during our staying. What can I say more ... 5star plus ": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 228, "out_tok": 62}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Tim had great communication and direction to let ourselves into the flat which we appreciated. The area of Camden is a gritting London neighbourhood which is what we wanted. The Market which is a 5 minute walk is on daily and you could really spend hours there. We felt safe with our two kids there and walking to and from the tube was easy. Having the large grocery store right on the way was also handy.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"safety\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 257, "out_tok": 61}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Nice and very frindly flat, exactly as showned on picture, nothing missed. Placed on a peachfull road within few meters from underground and restaurants and food stores.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"noise\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 210, "out_tok": 67}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Our stay was just perfect, a home from home and thanks to Anne who made us feel very welcomed! The location was convenient for trips to Knightsbridge and Central London with bus routes near by. Anne thoughtfully provided us with directions and bus numbers. The area is quiet and very pleasant to walk around, though sadly, we didn't have time to explore Battersea Park at the end of the road-next time! ": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"noise\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 259, "out_tok": 55}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|This was my first Airbnb experience and I thought it was great. Thanks to Anne for being a very lovely host. The room was great and was just as I had expected from the listings. Anne was helpful with travel info to get to her place, the room was good, the bed was comfy. I felt safe and secure and my trip was good. I also loved meeting Forest the Dog. Thanks Anne : )": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\",\n    \"safety\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 258, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Lovely big room in lovely big house on a really nice street. Great price, comfortable bed. Can't recommend more": {"output": "{\"sentiment\": \"positive\", \"aspects_positive\": [\"location\", \"amenities\", \"value\"], \"aspects_negative\": [], \"language\": \"en\"}", "in_tok": 199, "out_tok": 35}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Stayed there the second time. It's a very comfortable cosy appartment. I enjoyed my stay very much. Marco is making sure at all time that all works fine.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 210, "out_tok": 51}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Truly an excellent experience with an excellent hostess manager. Location is great to be close to everything and feel more local away from all of the tourism. Nice local pubs and great shopping nearby. Hope there is reason to come back to London and stay at Julia's place again!": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 229, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|The apartment was really nice. Comfortable, clean and quiet. The neighbourhood is residential, nice if you want to relax, only 1 block from Thames riverside. It's not very near from the underground. It's takes some time to go to central London, mostly at night. If you want to go to pubs, theatre and nightlife in general it's not the correct place. Nice to go with family and relax": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"mixed\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"noise\",\n    \"location\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [\n    \"location\"\n  ],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 261, "out_tok": 64}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|It was a perfect week. The flat is really beautiful and so comfortable the garden is a wonderful addition. The location of the flat was perfect for our Wembley concert and trip to Harry Potter studio. The flat had everything we needed and was a real home from home. The area was great between Queens Park and Kilburn High road. Nice pubs and shops nearby. Wonderful experience thanks you Tess.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"amenities\",\n    \"host\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 252, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|My stay at Richard's house was very enjoyable. The room was very comfortable and looked like on the pictures. House is located just couple of minutes away from the train station and buss stops. Richard was really helpful and kind. I would definitely recommend his house and I am pretty sure I will come back there next time I'll be in London. ": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 246, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|As everyone else has written Simon's flat is superb! We spent a wonderful week and found the flat to be extremely comfortable and spacious. The kitchen was fully equipped and we were able to cook some great meals. The bathroom is extremely modern with an excellent shower. The bedroom is comfy with plenty of storage space. The flat is very quiet and was an oasis of calm to come back to in the evening after long days that were spent exploring busy London. We would love to return.": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\",\n    \"noise\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 271, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Friendly, happy, welcoming lady with a lovely room! :) I was in and out most of the time but never felt unwelcome. Bumped into a couple of others sharing the house too who were lovely, respectful and quiet! Nice place! Thanks Eliana! ": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"noise\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 227, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Richard was warm and welcoming and the room and facilities were perfectly clean and comfortable. The location and the view are amazing - you can see all of London's landmarks from the window - but at night it's quiet and calm. We had a delicious breakfast nearby (thanks to Richard's recommendations!) and explored Greenwich and Blackheath which are right on the doorstep. This was our first airbnb experience and we were very pleased with it - we'd be very happy to come back!": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"amenities\",\n    \"noise\",\n    \"value\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 273, "out_tok": 72}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|It was a wonderful stay at Isabell's flat: a perfect place to start your tour at London and to relax after after a long day - it was like coming home. Isabelle is a very friendly person, attentive to our needs and she makes you feel to be welcome. The rooms are very comfortable and artfully furnished. Supermarket, bus, tube, pubs - everything is nearby. We would definitely come back to Isabelle and we can recommend this place to everybody!": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"location\",\n    \"host\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 269, "out_tok": 56}, "gemini-3.5-flash-lite|8b6b7293|Communication with Olga was good and the apartment is like in the pictures. Location is great. Just 5 minute walk from West Kensington Tube with shops, restaurants, a pub and Tesco express juts minutes away. Olga was friendly and also invited me to go with her to a huge park she frequents which was full of deer and a nice gesture from her. The apartment was clean and a good spot for a short stay in London. ": {"output": "{\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\",\n  \"aspects_positive\": [\n    \"host\",\n    \"location\",\n    \"cleanliness\",\n    \"amenities\"\n  ],\n  \"aspects_negative\": [],\n  \"language\": \"en\"\n}", "in_tok": 262, "out_tok": 62}}